    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="575a7900-8614-5281-afc8-e8bf3b09cca8" activityNameId="58b840c8-2190-54fe-b464-1b97e9ef2343" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Transformer, low voltage use, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Transformer, low voltage use, at plant
The data represent a typical low voltage transformer, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from the literature. Production efforts are approximated by using material specific treatment processes. Infrastructure is included in these production efforts approximation. The dataset represents 1 kg of transformers with a weight of 30 gram/unit.;
UUID: 3252ee98-dbf7-31ff-820c-b6e96e9740c9
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of power transformers used in the low voltage area, i.e. in an area of 5 up to about 25 V.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: average transformer production technology, based on literature and assumptions.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3252ee98-dbf7-31ff-820c-b6e96e9740c9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
